{"slug":"Untitled-Hood-Stand-Script-2226","_id":"6264d55bf69fa29db64dbaaa","title":"Stand Script","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c77f43","gameId":9183932460,"name":"Untitled Hood","imageUrl":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":9183932460},"features":"replace UserName with your main account's username\nexecute the script on a alt and yeah\nyou can execute on the same pc, seperate laptop, a phone too\n\ncommands:\n- kill! <displayname>\n- autokill! <displayname> (glitchy, say it again to toggle it off)\n- knock! <displayname>\n- bring! <displayname>\n- save! [displayname] (don't put a displayname if you want to save yourself\n- summon! (bring's the stand to u)\n- follow! (follow's the commander)\n- unfollow! (unfollows)\n- drop! (drop's the person its carrying)\n- reset! (reset's the stand)\n- rejoin! (rejoins the stand, incase if it gets glitched)\n- autostomp! (autostomp's every user that gets knocked, say it again to toggle it off)\n- add! <displayname> (adds them to the stand so they can use it. rejoin the stand to get rid of added users)\n-- Usage: command! [displayname] (displayname is not needed for save, and all features, and you don't need to fully type it out)\nif you're gonna steal at all or spread it around, give credits please","tags":[],"script":"getgenv().hosts = {\n    \"UserName\", -- main host, they can add ppl to the stand\n}\ngetgenv().users = {\n    \"UserName1\", -- default users, they can use the stand but they can't add ppl to the stand with the add! command\n}\n-- Usage: command! [displayname] (displayname is not needed for save, and all features, and you don't need to fully type it out)\n\nloadstring(game:HttpGet('https://raw.githubusercontent.com/laderite/zenx/main/scripts/Untitled_Hood_Stand.lua'))()","owner":{"_id":"61d4e24b8ae42daa57a6502f","username":"laderite","verified":true,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://cdn.ko